# PLACEHOLDER -- must be replaced with the real VAPID public key (the same
# one passed as the VapidPublicKey stack parameter) before this build is
# deployed. Left as an obvious placeholder rather than omitted: an absent
# value makes the Notify control silently vanish from the deployed app with
# nothing to say why; check-auth-env.js also warns (without blocking the
# deploy) if this still holds the placeholder or is missing entirely.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=REPLACE_WITH_REAL_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY_AT_DEPLOY_TIME
